# 報告（学習データが無くても報告を組み立てる関数を確かめる。期待値は Python で書いた参照実装で求めた）
小乗客CSV = 「PassengerId,Survived,Pclass,Sex,Age,SibSp,Parch,Ticket,Fare,Cabin,Embarked{改行}1,1,1,male,10,3,2,T1,54.4,C1,S{改行}2,0,3,female,,2,1,T2,21.7,,S{改行}3,0,3,male,36,0,2,T3,17.4,,S{改行}4,1,3,male,49,0,2,T4,35.3,,C{改行}5,1,1,female,,1,1,T5,70.6,C5,Q{改行}6,0,3,male,33,2,1,T6,12.7,,S{改行}7,1,1,male,68,3,2,T7,48.9,C7,C{改行}8,1,2,female,56,2,1,T8,36.3,,S{改行}9,0,3,male,63,1,1,T9,10,,{改行}10,1,3,female,55,2,1,T10,6.6,,Q{改行}11,1,3,female,,2,0,T11,52.1,,C{改行}12,1,3,male,1,2,1,T12,49,,S{改行}13,0,1,male,1,2,0,T13,22.3,C13,Q{改行}14,0,2,male,38,0,2,T14,59.1,,S{改行}15,0,2,male,50,3,2,T15,45.9,,S{改行}16,0,1,male,44,1,0,T16,11.7,C16,S{改行}17,1,1,male,17,0,0,T17,45.9,C17,C{改行}18,1,3,female,57,1,0,T18,21.7,,S{改行}19,0,1,male,46,0,2,T19,79.6,C19,Q{改行}20,1,3,female,10,0,0,T20,69.8,,S{改行}」
